      "slug": "bun-bowl",
      "term": "Bún bowl",
      "definition": "A Vietnamese rice vermicelli bowl served at room temperature rather than hot. It consists of cooked noodles topped with protein, fresh herbs, pickled vegetables, and a dressing poured over at the table."
    },
    {
      "slug": "nuoc-cham-bowl",
      "term": "Nước chấm",
      "definition": "The classic Vietnamese dipping sauce of fish sauce, lime, sugar, garlic, and chilli. In bún bowls it is poured over the whole dish as a dressing."
    }
